{"job_id":"F-2675ce8f64da74c6e24d","family_id":"F-2675ce8f64da74c6e24d","title":"명예교수규칙","prior_queue_status":"QUEUED","language":"zh","rows":[{"id":"B1-zh-00001","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-007135-273729-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":6,"target_id":"74f1fa9e0612955cbcab09c8536a2c70d1d9ef2a876dad52008130f3191766fc","source_hash":"b96ba79f01c754d6b35cda085865a73356d8367224facc06a365c4534a09bae6","text":"教授荣誉退休规则"},{"id":"B1-zh-00002","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-007135-273729-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":123,"target_id":"80ccc29ec188b06a780b396218a9a7146021ca3dc190c7f2df42931763e34722","source_hash":"bc160035c9b8a6a50bdfdf3b6186923dd3236deb1e6117782f1f18279e1c2710","text":"第一条（目的）本规则的目的是根据《高等教育法》第十七条和该法实施令第七条第一款的规定，规定名誉教授的资格、任命程序、服务年限以及其他与名誉教授任命相关的必要事项。<2025年9月17日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00003","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-007135-273729-ko","scope":"BODY","start":123,"end":291,"target_id":"1ef0773be9d21381ea04e39056a428f146d74b930deb0b4c6e4f582519d5a006","source_hash":"1cffe9ec414890bd13f2eeb59f14ffc13838b25c5476c1af2e426efeda4e6c22","text":"第二条（定义）本规则中的“荣誉教授”是指根据第三条和第四条提名，为表彰从大学（包括工业大学、师范大学、专科院校、广播大学、函授大学、广播函授大学和网络大学；以下同上）退休，且在任期间取得杰出成就的人员而设立的。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00004","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-007135-273729-ko","scope":"BODY","start":291,"end":539,"target_id":"2d38832f180c731cbd0a1bf2ddaaa1f7904dab183f6e7f80610555116f8ffd95","source_hash":"005196fa69b48d0cec9445cec5eda0f3225f79395f6f2c07d465682cad9e3b2d","text":"第三条（资格） 有资格被任命为荣誉教授的，是相关大学的教职人员，职称是助理教授或以上，任职时间超过学校规章规定的期限，且在退休时担任校长、院长或教授职务（包括根据《首尔国立大学设立及运营法》实施细则第三条第二款被派往首尔国立大学的公职人员，且在退休时担任校长、院长或教授职务），并且在任职期间取得了堪为其他教职人员典范的杰出教育或学术成就。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00005","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-007135-273729-ko","scope":"BODY","start":539,"end":711,"target_id":"5b9b2a960984a18509944bfb8134b452ff75780ed33d3a6f89cafcbd61e7347b","source_hash":"f36288e89142111d9bfc7962864658a0b9c9e70d23e66a8ba444f13ec42b7603","text":"第四条（提名程序）\n① 校长或院长（大学院长除外；以下简称“大学负责人”）必须获得相关大学人事委员会（私立大学为教务委员会）的同意才能任命名誉教授。\n② 除本规则对名誉教授任命程序另有规定外，其他事项均按相关大学的校规规定执行。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00006","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-007135-273729-ko","scope":"BODY","start":711,"end":812,"target_id":"9936273eb7f5f95586cbf1c3a24d729f01054d4e9ae502f1b8a6e0d71b451d59","source_hash":"69b3a39743be42bf84a0b14feb96ab2d402674c3efbd5ebb90b746b88d292ffd","text":"第五条（服务）名誉教授享有荣誉职位；但是，有关大学的校长可以指派名誉教授履行下列各款规定的职责。\n1. 主修领域的研究或讲座\n2. 与项目 1 相关的业务\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00007","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-007135-273729-ko","scope":"BODY","start":812,"end":942,"target_id":"0066bf5260e57637a6d925935cb05083fea28d35f1682e7de044ca53dc58f959","source_hash":"4efa4063ce476ab721caa85d71814b859c934afab2bd4453002fdf9e7c902077","text":"第六条（科研经费、讲课费等的支付）\n① 大学校长可以向荣誉退休教授支付以下费用。\n1. 研究经费\n2. 讲座费\n3. 津贴、差旅费或其他必要费用\n② 根据第1款规定支付的费用数额，由相关大学的负责人确定。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00008","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-007135-273729-ko","scope":"BODY","start":942,"end":1025,"target_id":"ff726603a342047109a9a5c2ad7202dffdcde9cb59bbf55e021f91164a9a3896","source_hash":"3c2fa9ffe0793c346a8d55ab0a69e6cf000e3ed37e277060f693cc64ab07f5e6","text":"第七条（设施使用）大学校长可以允许荣誉教授以与大学教职员工相同的待遇使用大学的设施，如图书馆或研究设施。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00009","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-007135-273729-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1025,"end":1070,"target_id":"a810b7711d0151d1c17c15d73707a3db1192d11324beb15a555f5b54acaaeb6d","source_hash":"7d37d7cbc0f038df7018172d9a7596eb5daaacb9822e93ded2fec82db420fac5","text":"补充规定 <第561号，1987年12月30日>\n\n本规则自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00010","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-007135-273729-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1070,"end":1130,"target_id":"3268379f9c6bb21d11ba7583b0e1b394ebbfb1f29d3cbc02582aa67c3089a3f6","source_hash":"94159b3c12d04c6f772d2135e6d311ef409fd86557e7b93918bbd3aaa39f3b95","text":"增补（关于各学校等相关规定的部分修订）<1991年3月16日第594号法令>\n\n本规则自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00011","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-007135-273729-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1130,"end":1173,"target_id":"e68e0578487de7209a189adff9aa3cc17760debf8eca41ce450f62cce1417c0e","source_hash":"81eae2aed9fbbae0b94704cafe5f744dd1834283f846a85923f03271999ac826","text":"补充条款 <第627号，1993年1月26日>\n\n本规则自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00012","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-007135-273729-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1173,"end":1216,"target_id":"40c05bc3dbb8c7cf5336dda27c204b8f9fa3b6aaeb83d8d9eac29031fc9aec61","source_hash":"a543d9a1770fde3990824a2268d1da488254934b862206869d42dc9bc76613db","text":"补充规定 <第760号，2000年1月18日>\n\n本规则自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00013","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-007135-273729-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1216,"end":1259,"target_id":"69fdb271fe80628c6e9d88270e200ec0c6ee6bd11459fbbd31ed80d3d928ca37","source_hash":"882f1ad183583d3cfd69034700a94d5e83b8f563e535d564cb1fbe287b07a751","text":"增补（教育部及其附属机构组织实施细则）<2001年1月31日第779号>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00014","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-007135-273729-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1259,"end":1290,"target_id":"6cc98177aedf5dbf88216b9e948032fe5e38020541463114bc1071ae7d3d6403","source_hash":"90858a9f0619781fd12c847a12960234f781a731d8df4c39550910624927ded0","text":"第一条（生效日期）本规则自公布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00015","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-007135-273729-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1290,"end":1298,"target_id":"9449090e68867542a4133663a47a3eea3442c602440a2b80d21726a3f4347eec","source_hash":"1fa2d78222cc5f3a7b268ba3015a524a8e57a9355a8b17e0ae4253566ef34323","text":"第 2 条已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00016","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-007135-273729-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1298,"end":1409,"target_id":"745d04d9d90b47a6340c374c85373bb609d54efff7755e3ab17b88033d22d390","source_hash":"7614862133260d358cb65d1527abdbdedd920a125efcd15c375b01fb902edbaa","text":"第三条（修改其他法律）①至<19> 已省略\n\n  <20> 荣誉教授规则修订如下。\n\n  第六条第二款中的“教育部长”应改为“教育和人力资源部长”。\n\n  <21> 至 <41> 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00017","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-007135-273729-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1409,"end":1453,"target_id":"bdc16ffbd2f898e05d150e74ed591944652feac26d532fe13cb0fb3d1c19b5dd","source_hash":"d2fbf77d9c2de540e2b1e40b834d574f736f412a73940fbb2e1a50af02ed4355","text":"增编（教育科学技术部及其附属机构组织结构实施细则）<2008年3月4日第1号>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00018","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-007135-273729-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1453,"end":1482,"target_id":"27807743c95e6280d94229643f47eea35e637dc85afb2641a487d5ee45728133","source_hash":"7e5f07ffff6aef2f2136019cfb5263979ba5a34dacd8394c05b2d3c719360d57","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00019","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-007135-273729-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1482,"end":1499,"target_id":"ce25ec340a185ffce922fda179d532f2547cc222875f5a43541b9bc48dce541f","source_hash":"6ffda08faf109c176be482db4409396ced46b0373db22ad766c9b45cca3b755a","text":"省略第2至4条\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00020","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-007135-273729-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1499,"end":1628,"target_id":"feee41e740506309710532b93f162f106505a550690b4c18c75cc7f776ed7095","source_hash":"dad536e096a6d8b41ccc85c4f9b85c9cbe9d6dc875edea410af236454983b9da","text":"第五条（修改其他法律）①至<21> 已省略\n\n  <22> 荣誉教授规则部分修订如下。\n\n  第六条第二款中的“教育和人力资源部长”应改为“教育、科学和技术部长”。\n\n  <23> 至 <63> 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00021","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-007135-273729-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1628,"end":1670,"target_id":"14ac95bde801f7fcefa3a17012de38c5f40a40767900411404b6ed4e6d30d7ea","source_hash":"acbf611113b71e40d8b24ed6cdf10cf3dd5c12d6a928ab0850aa8a02c31e461d","text":"增补（大学学费和入学费规定）<2008年9月29日第16号>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00022","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-007135-273729-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1670,"end":1700,"target_id":"43ac934ebc35dbffefcd4ca2b506d9e5efb959b49986e865df9458eda52f3464","source_hash":"0d63a18201aaf2f1d98d1a1c71f36ac02913f4fc2004246a24afe6bdd25c6c45","text":"第一条（生效日期）本规则自公布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00023","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-007135-273729-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1700,"end":1754,"target_id":"52e7cc9317594ec3bec9948d206ea5b98e06e217765a3a105dc1d2762aa1ed6b","source_hash":"eb9e6999d4367e9d9f647cb2c410172a800682f611534579fd086596cea9a91e","text":"第二条（修改其他法律）①和②已省略\n\n  ③ 对荣誉教授规则进行如下部分修改。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00024","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-007135-273729-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1754,"end":1826,"target_id":"8b214caddc04f0eb1dfa3ecd447a827d3dc2ad5949b07467b7a49d895db03c10","source_hash":"9914e900db5d8ed97d553eef06d842bece4ad26a7ab9041cffb1329bf918c385","text":"  第 2 条中的“韩国开放大学、函授大学和韩国开放大学”应改为“韩国开放大学、函授大学、韩国开放大学和网络大学”。\n\n  ④ 省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00025","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-007135-273729-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1826,"end":1869,"target_id":"823c60ffea7c1828fb9976463f6d7fc4e9850b4a2fb504cd431445e3e303e65d","source_hash":"527c769255ff8e2b849dfdae764ff72d52b069f182dcb0dba50707dc6d8f8f68","text":"补充规定 <2008年12月31日第26号>\n\n本规则自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00026","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-007135-273729-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1869,"end":1891,"target_id":"74224f98a51a9f3536da3ac9451ab098dcd39c478407036b7a22b6fd5cbd7c2e","source_hash":"01945bfbadd5448a3dd4b829abfd6027fdea6aab8a20184ed01cd669fddd5895","text":"补充规定 <第141号，2012年2月29日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00027","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-007135-273729-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1891,"end":1970,"target_id":"70297f63eeb853a823e88a16879182a0b7e26c2b4954ccde31747938a5867cc7","source_hash":"e2d8a7ac49c373e379f4db85abf0a36bc07b11f1c4b48da1b13634e156eb3c27","text":"第一条（生效日期）本规则自公布之日起生效。但是，第三条中关于助理教授的修正条款自2012年7月22日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00028","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-007135-273729-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1970,"end":2058,"target_id":"64de7a719c703db6cf8010d2f895189c4f04b4b271f6351ff934f066801f935c","source_hash":"783571f1c3b857a02c16ae3a46cda1d4baf2838c9fbb8b6ff151bb451dc7f0f0","text":"第二条（关于全职讲师服务期限的过渡措施）尽管第三条有修改规定，但以前规定的全职讲师的服务期限应视为修改后规定的助理教授的服务期限。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00029","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-007135-273729-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2058,"end":2099,"target_id":"2f0fcece3c08923b0e97056661e7af56d0677826e48536e88c717f8f0d8bef31","source_hash":"7d7018a18400db8d62f6b1536b1a627a8e636f6c249aced08ec620aa6f0b0672","text":"补充规定（教育部及其附属机构组织结构实施细则）<2013年3月23日第1号>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00030","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-007135-273729-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2099,"end":2137,"target_id":"01e2d08129d882cf8077ff2c196a6e65fbdda8f13cc9aafe0c9fa8738f9f2349","source_hash":"17f62718ec8681372d471c3803ff3647ee41b5c21c983badb3168350a437f2a5","text":"第一条（生效日期）本规则自公布之日起生效。<但书略>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00031","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-007135-273729-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2137,"end":2154,"target_id":"4d1c4df63637c616b353689fea215ee370a5e406d6cf57ec8d31bb3e2944b57e","source_hash":"bc6c318c350b2ff1aac4a31f65fcae9d049d5f2d9358ead70ed1a2e0bc93798c","text":"省略第2至6条\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00032","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-007135-273729-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2154,"end":2275,"target_id":"4ff5fc698a208fbc93fafbb39eb21aa146a6a91eeabb3955c5490a112d257f7b","source_hash":"a6f308566094457187431a984ecf536176a690c8f7aa295636152634c2835cce","text":"第七条（修改其他法律）①至<27> 已省略\n\n  <28> 荣誉教授规则部分修订如下。\n\n  第六条第二款中的“教育、科学和技术部长”应改为“教育部长”。\n\n  <29> 至 <61> 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00033","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-007135-273729-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2275,"end":2316,"target_id":"67df28f6455e457dae3f5575afab74d081ea04cc74779b9dd3892a6038c2f63d","source_hash":"e040ae2d3f656bd71bbc912d8ad5d658626edf5748e78c93bf3fc920881e599f","text":"补充规定 <第365号，2025年9月17日>\n\n本规则自颁布之日起生效。"}]}